      "comment": "PERPETUUS (1) has been thereabouts without winning, the latest finishing fourth (18.63) off a wide draw at this track in a Grade 5. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and two minor placings from six starts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. BAGOT BULLET (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Little Riley (18.45) in a Grade 5 /MDN. Can feature again. ZERO POINT (5) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 312m behind Bing Bing Secret (18.54) in a Grade 3/4. Can figure in the finish. CHEERS MICK (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
